## What's next (aligned with repo gaps)
- Remove legacy auth UI/blocs (`login_bloc`, dual-tab `login_screen`, duplicate `phone_auth_cubit`) after confirming router uses `features/auth` only.
- Role-based redirects in `router.dart` (customer vs rider).
- Continue feature-first migration (customer catalogue/orders, shared `lib/data/models`).
- Wire FCM where needed; keep Supabase as sole app data store.

## Do NOT
- Do not move identity to Supabase Auth or remove Firebase Auth for login.
- Do not use Firestore or introduce new state-management libraries.
- Do not bypass RLS with service_role in the app.
- Do not touch unrelated scopes when asked for focused work (e.g. auth-only tasks — skip cart/profile/medicine unless requested).
